{"seq":2,"slug":"concurrent-state-machines","title":"并发状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/advanced/concurrent-state-machines","wordCount":838,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"并发状态机\">并发状态机</h1><p>并发状态机（Concurrent State Machine）解决了 FSM 中的<strong>状态爆炸</strong>问题：当一个对象有多个独立的状态维度时，如果用单一 FSM 表示所有组合，状态数量会呈乘积增长。并发状态机允许多个 FSM 同时运行并各自独立管理一个维度，大幅降低复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>以一个动作 RPG 角色为例：角色同时有<strong>移动状态</strong>（Idle/Walk/Run/Jump）和<strong>武器状态</strong>（Unarmed/Sword/Bow/Magic）两个维度。如果用单一 FSM，需要 4×4=16 个状态。如果增加一个「生命状态」维度（Healthy/Wounded/Critical），状态数变为 4×4×3=48 个。</p>\n<p>并发状态机将这些维度分拆为独立的<strong>正交区域（Orthogonal Region）</strong>，每个区域独立运行：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[角色并发状态机] --&gt; B[移动区域]&#10;    A --&gt; C[武器区域]&#10;    A --&gt; D[生命状态区域]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Idle]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[Walk]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[Run]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[Jump]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Unarmed]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Sword]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[Bow]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[Magic]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Healthy]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[Wounded]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[Critical]\">graph TD\n    A[角色并发状态机] --&gt; B[移动区域]\n    A --&gt; C[武器区域]\n    A --&gt; D[生命状态区域]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[Idle]\n    B --&gt; B2[Walk]\n    B --&gt; B3[Run]\n    B --&gt; B4[Jump]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[Unarmed]\n    C --&gt; C2[Sword]\n    C --&gt; C3[Bow]\n    C --&gt; C4[Magic]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[Healthy]\n    D --&gt; D2[Wounded]\n    D --&gt; D3[Critical]</pre><p>三个区域独立运行，任意组合都是合法状态，无需枚举所有可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正交区域实现\">正交区域实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 单个区域：本质是一个独立的状态机&#10;public class StateMachineRegion&#10;{&#10;    private string regionName;&#10;    private Dictionary&lt;string, RegionState&gt; states&#10;        = new Dictionary&lt;string, RegionState&gt;();&#10;    private RegionState currentState;&#10;    private ConcurrentFSMContext context;&#10;&#10;    public string CurrentStateName&#10;        =&gt; currentState?.Name ?? &quot;None&quot;;&#10;&#10;    public void AddState(RegionState state)&#10;    {&#10;        states[state.Name] = state;&#10;        state.Region = this;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Start(string initialStateName)&#10;    {&#10;        currentState = states[initialStateName];&#10;        currentState.OnEnter(context);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void ChangeState(string newStateName)&#10;    {&#10;        if (!states.TryGetValue(newStateName, out var newState))&#10;        {&#10;            Debug.LogWarning($&quot;State {newStateName} not found in region {regionName}&quot;);&#10;            return;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        currentState?.OnExit(context);&#10;        currentState = newState;&#10;        currentState.OnEnter(context);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Update() =&gt; currentState?.OnUpdate(context);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 并发状态机：管理多个正交区域&#10;public class ConcurrentFSM&#10;{&#10;    private Dictionary&lt;string, StateMachineRegion&gt; regions&#10;        = new Dictionary&lt;string, StateMachineRegion&gt;();&#10;    private ConcurrentFSMContext context;&#10;&#10;    public void AddRegion(string regionName, StateMachineRegion region)&#10;    {&#10;        regions[regionName] = region;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Start()&#10;    {&#10;        foreach (var region in regions.Values)&#10;            region.Start(&quot;Initial&quot;); // 或各区域有自己的初始状态&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        // 所有区域同时 tick&#10;        foreach (var region in regions.Values)&#10;            region.Update();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void ChangeStateInRegion(string regionName, string stateName)&#10;    {&#10;        if (regions.TryGetValue(regionName, out var region))&#10;            region.ChangeState(stateName);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 获取所有区域的当前状态快照（调试/序列化用）&#10;    public Dictionary&lt;string, string&gt; GetCurrentStates()&#10;    {&#10;        return regions.ToDictionary(&#10;            kvp =&gt; kvp.Key,&#10;            kvp =&gt; kvp.Value.CurrentStateName);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 单个区域：本质是一个独立的状态机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class StateMachineRegion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private string regionName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Dictionary&#x3C;string, RegionState> states</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        = new Dictionary&#x3C;string, RegionState>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private RegionState currentState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private ConcurrentFSMContext context;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string CurrentStateName</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => currentState?.Name ?? \"None\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void AddState(RegionState state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        states[state.Name] = state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state.Region = this;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Start(string initialStateName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState = states[initialStateName];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState.OnEnter(context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ChangeState(string newStateName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!states.TryGetValue(newStateName, out var newState))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Debug.LogWarning($\"State {newStateName} not found in region {regionName}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState?.OnExit(context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState = newState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState.OnEnter(context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Update() => currentState?.OnUpdate(context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 并发状态机：管理多个正交区域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ConcurrentFSM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Dictionary&#x3C;string, StateMachineRegion> regions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        = new Dictionary&#x3C;string, StateMachineRegion>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private ConcurrentFSMContext context;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void AddRegion(string regionName, StateMachineRegion region)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        regions[regionName] = region;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Start()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var region in regions.Values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            region.Start(\"Initial\"); // 或各区域有自己的初始状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 所有区域同时 tick</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var region in regions.Values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            region.Update();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ChangeStateInRegion(string regionName, string stateName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (regions.TryGetValue(regionName, out var region))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            region.ChangeState(stateName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 获取所有区域的当前状态快照（调试/序列化用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Dictionary&#x3C;string, string> GetCurrentStates()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return regions.ToDictionary(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            kvp => kvp.Key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            kvp => kvp.Value.CurrentStateName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"区域间通信\">区域间通信</h2><p>正交区域是相互独立的，但实际游戏中区域间往往需要协调。常用的通信方式：</p>\n<p><strong>共享上下文（推荐）</strong>：所有区域共享一个只读的上下文对象，从中读取彼此的状态和数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class ConcurrentFSMContext&#10;{&#10;    // 共享数据&#10;    public Vector3 Velocity { get; set; }&#10;    public float Health { get; set; }&#10;    public bool IsGrounded { get; set; }&#10;&#10;    // 各区域的当前状态（只读访问）&#10;    private ConcurrentFSM owner;&#10;&#10;    public string GetRegionState(string regionName)&#10;        =&gt; owner.GetRegion(regionName)?.CurrentStateName;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 武器区域读取移动区域的状态&#10;public class SwordState : RegionState&#10;{&#10;    public override void OnUpdate(ConcurrentFSMContext ctx)&#10;    {&#10;        string moveState = ctx.GetRegionState(&quot;Movement&quot;);&#10;&#10;        // 跳跃中使用剑时，执行空中斩击而不是地面斩击&#10;        if (moveState == &quot;Jump&quot;)&#10;            ExecuteAerialSlash();&#10;        else&#10;            ExecuteGroundSlash();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class ConcurrentFSMContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 共享数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Vector3 Velocity { get; set; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float Health { get; set; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public bool IsGrounded { get; set; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 各区域的当前状态（只读访问）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private ConcurrentFSM owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string GetRegionState(string regionName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => owner.GetRegion(regionName)?.CurrentStateName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 武器区域读取移动区域的状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class SwordState : RegionState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate(ConcurrentFSMContext ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string moveState = ctx.GetRegionState(\"Movement\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 跳跃中使用剑时，执行空中斩击而不是地面斩击</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (moveState == \"Jump\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ExecuteAerialSlash();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ExecuteGroundSlash();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>事件总线</strong>：一个区域发布事件，另一个区域订阅响应：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 移动区域发布跳跃事件&#10;public class JumpState : RegionState&#10;{&#10;    public override void OnEnter(ConcurrentFSMContext ctx)&#10;    {&#10;        EventBus.Publish(new JumpStartedEvent());&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 武器区域响应跳跃事件&#10;public class BowState : RegionState&#10;{&#10;    public override void OnEnter(ConcurrentFSMContext ctx)&#10;    {&#10;        EventBus.Subscribe&lt;JumpStartedEvent&gt;(OnJumpStarted);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnExit(ConcurrentFSMContext ctx)&#10;    {&#10;        EventBus.Unsubscribe&lt;JumpStartedEvent&gt;(OnJumpStarted);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnJumpStarted(JumpStartedEvent e)&#10;    {&#10;        // 跳跃时弓箭自动收起&#10;        Region.ChangeState(&quot;Unarmed&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 移动区域发布跳跃事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class JumpState : RegionState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnEnter(ConcurrentFSMContext ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EventBus.Publish(new JumpStartedEvent());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 武器区域响应跳跃事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class BowState : RegionState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnEnter(ConcurrentFSMContext ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EventBus.Subscribe&#x3C;JumpStartedEvent>(OnJumpStarted);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnExit(ConcurrentFSMContext ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EventBus.Unsubscribe&#x3C;JumpStartedEvent>(OnJumpStarted);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnJumpStarted(JumpStartedEvent e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 跳跃时弓箭自动收起</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Region.ChangeState(\"Unarmed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"优先级与区域同步\">优先级与区域同步</h2><p>某些情况下，区域间需要更强的同步协议：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 死亡状态需要强制所有区域进入 Dead 状态&#10;public class HealthRegion : StateMachineRegion&#10;{&#10;    private ConcurrentFSM owner;&#10;&#10;    private void TransitionToDead()&#10;    {&#10;        // 强制所有其他区域进入 Dead 状态&#10;        owner.ChangeStateInRegion(&quot;Movement&quot;, &quot;Dead&quot;);&#10;        owner.ChangeStateInRegion(&quot;Weapon&quot;, &quot;Unarmed&quot;);&#10;        owner.ChangeStateInRegion(&quot;Health&quot;, &quot;Dead&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 死亡状态需要强制所有区域进入 Dead 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class HealthRegion : StateMachineRegion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private ConcurrentFSM owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void TransitionToDead()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 强制所有其他区域进入 Dead 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        owner.ChangeStateInRegion(\"Movement\", \"Dead\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        owner.ChangeStateInRegion(\"Weapon\", \"Unarmed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        owner.ChangeStateInRegion(\"Health\", \"Dead\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通信方式</th>\n<th>耦合度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享上下文（只读）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>区域需要读取彼此数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件总线</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>松散的响应关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接调用区域方法</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>强同步需求，如死亡状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"组合爆炸的实际边界\">组合爆炸的实际边界</h2><p>并发状态机解决了状态爆炸，但引入了另一种复杂度：<strong>区域间交互的复杂度</strong>。实际使用建议：</p>\n<p><strong>保持区域数量可控</strong>：超过 4-5 个正交区域时，区域间的交互逻辑变得难以推理。如果区域过多，考虑将相关区域合并或用行为树替代。</p>\n<p><strong>最小化区域间依赖</strong>：理想的正交区域应该是真正独立的，区域间的依赖越多，并发状态机的优势越弱。</p>\n<p><strong>避免区域间循环依赖</strong>：区域 A 改变区域 B 的状态，而区域 B 的状态又改变区域 A，会导致同一帧内多次状态切换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动画系统中的并发状态机\">动画系统中的并发状态机</h2><p>Unity Animator 的**动画层（Animation Layer）**本质上就是并发状态机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Layer 0（BaseLayer，weight=1）: 全身动画&#10;  Idle ↔ Walk ↔ Run ↔ Jump&#10;&#10;Layer 1（UpperBody，weight=1，Avatar Mask: 上半身）: 上半身动画&#10;  Unarmed ↔ AimPistol ↔ AimRifle&#10;&#10;Layer 2（Face，weight=1，Avatar Mask: 头部）: 表情动画&#10;  Neutral ↔ Happy ↔ Scared\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Layer 0（BaseLayer，weight=1）: 全身动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Idle ↔ Walk ↔ Run ↔ Jump</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Layer 1（UpperBody，weight=1，Avatar Mask: 上半身）: 上半身动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Unarmed ↔ AimPistol ↔ AimRifle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Layer 2（Face，weight=1，Avatar Mask: 头部）: 表情动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Neutral ↔ Happy ↔ Scared</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三层动画同时运行，各自独立管理，通过 Avatar Mask 控制影响的骨骼范围，互不干扰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>并发状态机通过正交区域将多维度状态分离管理，将状态数量从乘积增长降为线性增长。核心设计原则：区域应尽量保持独立，通过共享上下文或事件总线进行必要的通信，避免区域间直接调用导致耦合。当区域数量超过 4-5 个时，重新评估是否用行为树等替代方案更合适。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"pushdown-automata\">下推自动机与状态栈</a> — 单维度状态的暂停/恢复能力</li>\n<li><a href=\"data-driven-state-config\">数据驱动状态配置</a> — 并发状态机的多区域定义可通过数据驱动配置</li>\n<li><a href=\"../fundamentals/hierarchical-state-machines\">层次状态机</a> — 并发状态机与 HFSM 常组合使用：每个正交区域内部是一个 HFSM</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并发状态机","id":"并发状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"正交区域实现","id":"正交区域实现"},{"level":2,"text":"区域间通信","id":"区域间通信"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级与区域同步","id":"优先级与区域同步"},{"level":2,"text":"组合爆炸的实际边界","id":"组合爆炸的实际边界"},{"level":2,"text":"动画系统中的并发状态机","id":"动画系统中的并发状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"下推自动机与状态栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/advanced/pushdown-automata"},"next":{"title":"数据驱动状态配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/advanced/data-driven-state-config"}}